.\" RamkolFX - GPL-3.0-only (or a separate commercial license); see LICENSE.
.TH RAMKOLFXD 1 "" "RamkolFX @RAMKOLFX_VERSION_FULL@" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
ramkolfxd \- 3D spatial audio, EQ and bass enhancer daemon for PipeWire
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B ramkolfxd
.RB [ \-V | \-\-version ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B ramkolfxd
creates a virtual PipeWire sink named
.BR ramkolfx_virtual_sink ,
processes whatever is played into it and plays the result out through a
real output device.
Processing consists of HRTF binaural rendering or ambisonics speaker
virtualisation, a 10\-band graphic EQ and a psychoacoustic bass enhancer.
.PP
The daemon runs in the user's session, normally as a systemd user service:
.PP
.RS
.B systemctl \-\-user enable \-\-now ramkolfxd
.RE
.PP
It is controlled over a Unix socket, usually with
.BR ramkolfx\-gui (1).
Only one instance runs per user.
.PP
Auto\-detect, which picks an EQ preset from what is playing, needs ONNX
Runtime 1.17 or newer.
Without it, Auto\-detect is reported as unavailable and everything else works.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BR \-V ", " \-\-version
Print the version and exit.
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
.B RAMKOLFX_HRTF_DIR
An extra directory to search for
.I .sofa
HRTF files, in addition to
.IR $XDG_CONFIG_HOME/ramkolfx/hrtf .
.TP
.B RAMKOLFX_HRTF_SOFA
Load this
.I .sofa
file as the HRTF, ignoring the saved choice.
.TP
.B RAMKOLFX_MODEL_DIR
Directory holding the Auto\-detect model
.RI ( audio_classifier.onnx ),
instead of
.IR @RAMKOLFX_MODEL_DATA_DIR@ .
.TP
.B RAMKOLFX_ORT_LIB
Full path of the ONNX Runtime library to load, instead of searching
.B LD_LIBRARY_PATH
and the usual library directories.
.TP
.B RAMKOLFX_DETECT_DUMP
For debugging Auto\-detect: write the audio it classifies, as WAV files,
to this directory.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I $XDG_CONFIG_HOME/ramkolfx/settings.conf
Saved settings.
.TP
.I $XDG_CONFIG_HOME/ramkolfx/presets.conf
EQ presets and which output devices and apps they are bound to.
.TP
.I $XDG_CONFIG_HOME/ramkolfx/hrtf/
Your own
.I .sofa
HRTF files; they appear in the HRTF list next to the bundled ones.
.TP
.I @RAMKOLFX_HRTF_DATA_DIR@/
The bundled HRTFs.
.TP
.I @RAMKOLFX_MODEL_DATA_DIR@/
The bundled Auto\-detect model.
.TP
.I $XDG_RUNTIME_DIR/ramkolfx/control.sock
The control socket.
.PP
.I $XDG_CONFIG_HOME
defaults to
.IR ~/.config .
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR ramkolfx\-gui (1),
.BR pipewire (1),
.BR systemctl (1)
.PP
.UR https://github.com/Coldsteel48/RamkolFX
.UE
